    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="35.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 35.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="35.3" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he hine on bysmer to homelan bescire, mid X scll' gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="35.3" corresp="#wit-e">Gif he hine on bismor to homolan bescire, mid X scill. gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="35.3" corresp="#wit-q">Si eum radat in contumeliam ad collificum, decem sol. emendet.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="36.3" corresp="#wit-e">Gif he hine on bismor to homolan bescire, mid X scill gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e">If he shears his hair to the point of mutilation to shame him, let him pay with 10 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e">If he cuts his hair to insult him, in such a way as to spoil his appearance, he shall pay 10 shillings compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn er ihn zum Schimpf zum Verstümmelten schert, büsse er mit 10 Schill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If he shaves him in disgrace like a mutilated man, let him pay 10 shillings.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
